  "annotation": "This workflow generates and annotates Metagenome-Assembled Genomes (MAGs) from raw metagenomic short (and optionally long) reads (quality control, host/contaminant removal, assembly, binning, bin refinement, quality filtering, dereplication, taxonomic, genomic, and functional annotation). Cite the FAIRyMAGs workflow suite (doi:10.64898/2026.07.31.741430) and the tools used; record the workflow version and Galaxy server.",
