        "comments": [
          {
            "color": "lime",
            "data": {
              "text": "In this workflow, we recommend nanopore samples since we are using some tools that are specified for nanopore such as: Minimap2, Nanoplot porechp and fastp.\n\nIn order to switch to illumina please remove the nanoplot step, replace porechop and fastp with cutadapt or trimmomatic, and finally replace Minimap2 with  Bowtie2.\n\nThis workflow also take single-end reads to switch to paired-end, you have to check this option in most of the tools used. "
            },
