            "color": "pink",
            "position": [
              4760,
              115
            ],
            "size": [
              380,
              260
            ],
            "data": {
              "text": "## 7. Abundance and reports\n\nCoverM estimates representative MAG abundance in the original samples. CheckM, CheckM2 and QUAST assess MAG quality. Join abundance and assembly-quality tables across samples, then collect results in a MultiQC report."
            }
          },
